  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "qt5-qtbase security update",
      "Title": "Synopsis",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for qt5-qtbase is now available for openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This package provides base tools, such as string, xml, and network handling.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nUncontrolled recursion in Qt's QDomDocument serialization (QtXml) lets deeply nested untrusted XML crash the app via stack exhaustion (DoS only).(CVE-2026-11573)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for qt5-qtbase is now available for master/openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4/openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4/openEuler-24.03-LTS-Next/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of high. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "High",
      "Title": "Severity",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "qt5-qtbase",
      "Title": "Affected Component",
      "Type": "General"
    }
  ],
